{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Air Hockey Simulator, it\u2019s all speed and impact! Swoosh across the table, smash the puck, dodge, strike\u2014BAM! Every second counts in this lightning-fast clash of reflexes and precision! Are you ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/46f416793409e7c0061aaea6e8a3183e.poster.avif?t=1764776955\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/46f416793409e7c0061aaea6e8a3183e.webm?t=1764776955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/46f416793409e7c0061aaea6e8a3183e.mp4?t=1764776955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Air Hockey Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air Hockey Simulator features 3 exciting game modes: Quick Match for instant action, Crazy Match with unpredictable twists, and Tournament for a structured challenge. Choose from 5 difficulty levels to match your skill and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/1b9ed393859082e7ee40ddad5bbe743a.poster.avif?t=1764776955\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/1b9ed393859082e7ee40ddad5bbe743a.webm?t=1764776955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/1b9ed393859082e7ee40ddad5bbe743a.mp4?t=1764776955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience with 3 mallet skins, 3 puck designs, and 3 table styles. Fast-paced gameplay and responsive physics make each match intense, competitive, and endlessly replayable.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936960?t=1764776955","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936960?t=1764776955","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/0437c356e25c06c9a4598359e013364e553800a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764776955","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/0437c356e25c06c9a4598359e013364e553800a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764776955","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Air Hockey Simulator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/3cadb4a15d60d9d8e490839d699e241b.avif?t=1764776955\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Air Hockey Simulator, it\u2019s all speed and impact! Swoosh across the table, smash the puck, dodge, strike\u2014BAM! Every second counts in this lightning-fast clash of reflexes and precision! Are you ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/46f416793409e7c0061aaea6e8a3183e.poster.avif?t=1764776955\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936960/extras/46f416793409e7c0061aaea6e8a3183e.webm?t=1764776955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s